<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Tis now in part I know His love;</l><l>Bright sunbeams shine from skies above;</l><l>But glories more exceeding far,</l><l>Shall rise beyond life’s evening star.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>’Tis now in part I understand</l><l>The leadings of my Father’s hand;</l><l>But I shall own His ways were right,</l><l>When welcomed to His presence bright.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>’Tis now in part, but O how sweet</l><l>To rest by faith at His dear feet;</l><l>Though now we see as through a glass,</l><l>The veil will lift, the shadows pass.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
